randomboubles_research_page.RBMASTEROFTHEELEMENTALRINGS.1=By forcing far more energy into such a small item as an ring, you've exhausted this avenue of research.<BR>Perhaps it's time to look at different ways of strengthening the rings...
randomboubles_research_name.RBTHEORYRINGOFCOMBINATIONS=Ring Combinations
randomboubles_research_text.RBTHEORYRINGOFCOMBINATIONS=Combined Magical Might
randomboubles_research_page.RBTHEORYRINGOFCOMBINATIONS.1=A breakthrough!<BR>By focusing on making the rings interact with eachother. You have noticed that you can combine different rings together in order to make them affect multiple aspects.<BR><BR>Now then...<BR>To research what combinations are possible...
randomboubles_research_name.RBTHEORYRINGOFMAGICALPROTECTION=Protection Theory
randomboubles_research_text.RBTHEORYRINGOFMAGICALPROTECTION=Knowledge Overload
randomboubles_research_page.RBTHEORYRINGOFMAGICALPROTECTION.1=While tinkering with the rings you have created, you had a sudden realization: they all seem to be receptive of the Runic Shield enchantment. Multiple levels can be applied, but the costs will scale like normal.

randomboubles_research_name.RBSPELLCASTERSRINGOFTHESKY=The Spellcaster's First Combination
randomboubles_research_text.RBSPELLCASTERSRINGOFTHESKY=Looking to the Sky
randomboubles_research_page.RBSPELLCASTERSRINGOFTHESKY.1=By taking inspiration on how the energies of the sky interact with each other, you have figured out that a combination of Air, Fire and Order comes together in harmony.<BR><BR>The pearl will be returned after the infusion is finished.<BR><BR>Sadly the final ring loses a lot of its energies, but perhaps you can find a way to restore its lost power...
randomboubles_research_page.RBSPELLCASTERSRINGOFTHESKY.WG.1=By taking inspiration on how the energies of the sky interact with each other, you have figured out that a combination of Air, Fire and Order comes together in harmony.<BR><BR>This drains most of the Primordial Pearl's energy, leaving behind a Powerless Pearl.<BR><BR>Sadly the final ring loses a lot of its energies, but perhaps you can find a way to restore its lost power...
randomboubles_research_name.RBEXOTICRINGOFTHESKY=The Second Combination of the Sky
randomboubles_research_text.RBEXOTICRINGOFTHESKY=Refining the energies of the Sky
randomboubles_research_page.RBEXOTICRINGOFTHESKY.1=You have found that the only way of restoring power to the ring is by merging multiple of them together.<BR><BR>This step also leaves behind a Primordial Pearl.
randomboubles_research_page.RBEXOTICRINGOFTHESKY.WG.1=You have found that the only way of restoring power to the ring is by merging multiple of them together.<BR><BR>This step also leaves behind a Powerless Pearl.
