randomboubles_research_text.RBRUNEFORGEDRINGOFTHESKY=Tuning the energies of the Sky
randomboubles_research_page.RBRUNEFORGEDRINGOFTHESKY.1=Finally, the true power of the ring has been revealed.<BR><BR>This step also leaves behind a Primordial Pearl.
randomboubles_research_page.RBRUNEFORGEDRINGOFTHESKY.GTNH.1=Finally, the true power of the ring has been revealed.<BR><BR>This consumes even more of the pearl's energy, leaving behind an Inert Pearl Fragment.

