randomboubles_research_name.RBTHAUMATURGESRING=The Thaumaturge's Ring
randomboubles_research_text.RBTHAUMATURGESRING=A ring for all Aspects
randomboubles_research_page.RBTHAUMATURGESRING.1=By combining the Ring of the Sky and the Ring of the Earth, you have managed to craft the ultimate ring of aspects.<BR><BR>This infusion also leaves behind an Primordial Pearl<BR><BR>This ring is capable of protecting its wearer from mundane poisons and withering, and it also comes with a simple runic shielding enchantment. However, this has come at the expense of much of its ability to channel vis. Time to once again find a way to restore its power...
randomboubles_research_page.RBTHAUMATURGESRING.GTNH.1=By combining the Ring of the Sky and the Ring of the Earth, you have managed to craft the ultimate ring of aspects.<BR><BR>This infusion also leaves behind an Inert Pearl Fragment<BR><BR>This ring is capable of protecting its wearer from mundane poisons and withering, and it also comes with a simple runic shielding enchantment. However, this has come at the expense of much of its ability to channel vis. Time to once again find a way to restore its power...
