randomboubles_research_text.RBEXOTICTHAUMATURGESRING=Empowered by all Aspects
randomboubles_research_page.RBEXOTICTHAUMATURGESRING.1=As before, only by combining multiple rings can their true power be restored.<BR><BR>Unlike before, this infusion will fully consume the Primordial Pearl.
