randomboubles_research_text.RBRUNEFORGEDTHAUMATURGESRING=The final ring of all Aspects
randomboubles_research_page.RBRUNEFORGEDTHAUMATURGESRING.1=Infusing one final Primordial Pearl into your ring creates the final combination of them all, which is fit for complete control of every aspect.
